## Troubleshooting Production Issues

### Common Issues

| Issue | Symptoms | Solution |
|-------|----------|----------|
| High task queue lag | Workflows not starting | Scale up workers |
| Memory leaks | OOM errors | Review activity implementations |
| Database connection exhaustion | Connection timeouts | Increase pool size or add replicas |
| Slow workflow execution | High P99 latency | Optimize activities, check DB performance |
| Worker crashes | Pods restarting | Check logs, fix bugs, add error handling |

### Debugging Tools

```bash
# Check worker health
kubectl logs -n production deployment/temporal-worker --tail=100

# Check Temporal service health
kubectl logs -n temporal statefulset/temporal-frontend --tail=100

# Query workflow execution
temporal workflow describe --workflow-id=<id>

# List failed workflows
temporal workflow list --query='ExecutionStatus="Failed"'

# Show workflow history
temporal workflow show --workflow-id=<id> --run-id=<run-id>
```

→ See `temporal-workers.mdc` for worker configuration
